e','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯混元发布开源端到端OCR模型HyOCR-1.5，推理提速6.37倍</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">QuestMobile发布六月AI原生App榜单：豆包月活达3.8亿居首，千问增速暴涨</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">Meta斥资500亿美元扩建路易斯安那州数据中心，算力规模提升至5GW</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌将自研TPU从内部工具转为对外商用，直接挑战英伟达AI芯片市场地位</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/6908788111d144011217c172eefd50c2.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌正加速将自研张量处理单元（TPU）从内部工具转型为对外销售的商用AI芯片，通过与博通合作，正式向外部客户提供AI基础设施解决方案。目前，谷歌已与Anthropic达成协议，后者将部署多达100万颗第七代TPU用于训练Claude模型。谷歌表示，其TPU处理AI工作负载的成本较竞争对手低约30%。在产品布局上，谷歌已发布针对训练和推理任务优化的第八代TPU，预计今年晚些时候上市。尽管目前约75%至80%的TPU产能仍服务于内部业务，但产能扩张迅速，预计到2027年年产量可达500万块。这一战略转变被视为英伟达GPU在AI芯片市场主导地位面临的最具结构性威胁，标志着谷歌正式以硬件供应商身份进入市场竞争，将深刻影响未来AI算力格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">英伟达营收逼近千亿大关，黄仁勋亲自回应架构延期传闻</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/3371edac10193960308e8a3aac430def.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">英伟达营收逼近千亿大关，黄仁勋亲自回应架构延期传闻AIbase基地发布于AI新闻资讯 · 1 分钟阅读 · Jul 14, 202614在近期举办的一场行业交流会上，英伟达首席执行官黄仁勋向投资者传递了明确信号：尽管公司季度营收已逼近 1000 亿美元大关，但其增长动力并未放缓，反而呈现出加速态势。面对外界对于ASIC（专用集成电路）竞争加剧及产品路线图的质疑，管理层给予了积极回应，重申了公司在AI算力市场的核心竞争力。针对此前市场流传的下一代旗舰架构Rubin Ultra将推迟至 2028 年的传闻，黄仁勋予以明确否认。他强调，Rubin Ultra仍将严格按照既定计划于明年出货。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯混元发布开源端到端OCR模型HyOCR-1.5，推理提速6.37倍</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/bc8a0302d9c76c58b966aafbbb70590e.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯混元正式发布轻量化端到端OCR专家模型HyOCR-1.5，该模型仅含1B参数，并实现全栈开源，包括模型权重、训练配方及推理框架。为解决长自回归解码延迟，团队引入DFlash投机解码框架，利用90.7M参数草稿模型并行预测，在OmniDocBench测评中实现6.37倍推理加速。HyOCR-1.5采用“智能体驱动数据流”策略，补齐了古文字识别、低资源语种及跨页多图问答等长尾场景短板，并支持4K分辨率输入与128K上下文窗口。评测显示，其在古文字识别及图表解析任务中性能可比肩8B规模通用模型。该模型不仅降低了开发门槛，支持在消费级显卡或笔记本电脑部署，还为本地化文档智能处理提供了高效方案，推动了端到端OCR技术的普惠化落地。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">QuestMobile发布六月AI原生App榜单：豆包月活达3.8亿居首，千问增速暴涨</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/b7cfaf806f99bf4a44dc87431ab593e4.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">QuestMobile发布2026年上半年AI应用市场洞察报告，截至5月，AI原生App月活用户达4.99亿，同比增长85.4%，月人均使用时长达183分钟。在AI原生App领域，豆包、千问、DeepSeek稳居第一梯队，月活规模分别为3.82亿、1.67亿和1.30亿。其中，豆包同比增长172.1%，千问增长率高达5792.9%，马太效应显著。用户黏性方面，豆包、DeepSeek、Kimi的10分钟以上用户占比均有提升，分别达到27.5%、30.0%和26.1%。豆包App在6月较5月新增1378万用户，显示出“普惠+增值”模式下的用户韧性。目前，AI原生App增速位居行业首位，正快速改写由终端厂商AI应用（7.55亿月活）和AI应用插件（6.44亿月活）主导的市场格局。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">Meta斥资500亿美元扩建路易斯安那州数据中心，算力规模提升至5GW</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/42c9684ab2e30aa12f8450167556c526.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">Meta近日宣布对其位于路易斯安那州里奇兰教区的数据中心进行大规模扩容，投资额超500亿美元，旨在将算力规模提升至5GW量级。该项目不仅支持深度基础设施建设，还包含配套劳动力培训。Meta承诺自行承担运营中的能源、水资源及维护成本，并额外投入超10亿美元用于当地道路、供水及污水处理等公共基础设施升级。为保障电力供应，Meta已与安特吉公司（Entergy）达成战略协议，将资助七座新建天然气发电厂、三个电网级储能电池项目及核电增容计划。此次扩建标志着科技巨头正从单纯硬件采购转向深度参与能源等底层基础设施建设，5GW的算力规模将显著增强Meta的模型训练与推理能力，对全球AI产业算力格局产生深远影响。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
